"Pseudo-random function extension for deriving symmetric secrets bound to a credential.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"PRF","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" lets a relying party derive deterministic symmetric secrets from a credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"— the same input produces the same output every time the user authenticates with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"that credential. It’s the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/www.w3.org\/TR\/webauthn-3\/#prf-extension","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for credential-bound key derivation, built on the CTAP2 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hmac-secret"},{"type":"text","text":" extension."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The SDK transforms each PRF input with "},{"code":"SHA-256(\"WebAuthn PRF\\0\" || input)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sending it to the authenticator — that domain separation is mandated by the spec."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In a high-level WebAuthn flow, configure ","type":"text"},{"code":"PRF","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" per ceremony via","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/RegistrationInputs\/prf","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/AuthenticationInputs\/prf","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"; outputs come back on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"clientExtensionResults","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of the corresponding ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Response"},{"text":". Registration enables","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"PRF on a credential, optionally deriving secrets at the same time on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"authenticators that support hmac-secret-mc. Authentication evaluates the PRF at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"one or more inputs and returns the derived bytes."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Registration: enable PRF on the new credential","let regOpts = WebAuthn.Registration.Options(","    challenge: challenge,","    rp: .init(id: \"example.com\", name: \"Example\"),","    user: .init(id: userId, name: \"alice@example.com\"),","    extensions: .init(prf: .enable)",")","let registration = try await client.makeCredential(regOpts, authorization: auth).value","","\/\/ Authentication: derive a secret bound to the credential","let authOpts = WebAuthn.Authentication.Options(","    challenge: challenge,","    rpId: \"example.com\",","    allowCredentials: [.init(id: storedCredentialId)],","    extensions: .init(prf: .eval(first: encryptionSeed))",")","let assertions = try await client.getAssertion(authOpts, authorization: auth).value","let derived = assertions.first?.clientExtensionResults.prf?.results.first"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For multi-credential flows where each credential needs different inputs, populate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF\/Authentication\/Input\/evalByCredential"},{"text":" with secrets keyed by credential id, with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF\/Authentication\/Input\/eval","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" as the default for credentials not in the map.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoi